port/gfx/fast3d/shim: stand-ins for the parts of libultraship's Ship framework and its
third-party dependencies (spdlog, ImGui, SDL3, nlohmann_json, BS::thread_pool) that
the Fast3D sources include. They are searched BEFORE libultraship's own include/, so
only src/fast/interpreter.cpp, src/fast/backends/gfx_opengl.cpp and
src/fast/debug/GfxDebugger.cpp are compiled from LUS, against these declarations.
Each header declares only what those three files use; port/gfx/fast3d/ship_shim.cpp
defines it. No LUS source is copied here. Plan section 19.6.
